List of maintainers and how to submit changes
=============================================

How to submit a change: CONTRIBUTING.md. A pull request is reviewed by
the maintainer of the area it touches and merged by a maintainer once it
has the tags it needs.

The entries have the kernel's form: M: maintainer, F: files.

